VALUES ('cloze-real-2023-1','cloze','real','{"type":"real","meta":{"year":2023,"region":"广东"}}','2023年真题·完形填空 Passage 1',3,'["上下文逻辑","词义辨析"]','{"id":"cloze-real-2023-1","type":"cloze","source":{"type":"real","meta":{"year":2023,"region":"广东"}},"passage":"When Li Hua entered college, she was too shy to speak in class. She decided to [[1]] this problem step by step. First, she practiced answering questions in [[2]] of a mirror at home. Then she [[3]] a small study group with three classmates. At first, her voice [[4]], but her friends encouraged her to continue. Week by week, her confidence [[5]]. By the end of the term, she could give a ten-minute speech without [[6]]. Looking back, she believes the key was not [[7]] but practice. “Everyone can improve [[8]] they are willing to try,” she says. Now she [[9]] newcomers in her department, sharing the same advice: start small, and never [[10]] up.","blanks":[{"id":1,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"face"},{"key":"B","text":"avoid"},{"key":"C","text":"hide"},{"key":"D","text":"enjoy"}]},{"id":2,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"need"},{"key":"B","text":"front"},{"key":"C","text":"middle"},{"key":"D","text":"side"}]},{"id":3,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"joined"},{"key":"B","text":"refused"},{"key":"C","text":"broke"},{"key":"D","text":"sold"}]},{"id":4,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"rose"},{"key":"B","text":"shook"},{"key":"C","text":"carried"},{"key":"D","text":"sang"}]},{"id":5,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"fell"},{"key":"B","text":"disappeared"},{"key":"C","text":"grew"},{"key":"D","text":"stopped"}]},{"id":6,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"fear"},{"key":"B","text":"notes"},{"key":"C","text":"applause"},{"key":"D","text":"interest"}]},{"id":7,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"talent"},{"key":"B","text":"money"},{"key":"C","text":"luck"},{"key":"D","text":"time"}]},{"id":8,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"as long as"},{"key":"B","text":"as if"},{"key":"C","text":"even though"},{"key":"D","text":"in case"}]},{"id":9,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"charges"},{"key":"B","text":"teaches"},{"key":"C","text":"helps"},{"key":"D","text":"watches"}]},{"id":10,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"put"},{"key":"B","text":"stand"},{"key":"C","text":"wake"},{"key":"D","text":"give"}]}]}','{"blanks":[{"id":1,"answer":"A","explanation":"face this problem 意为“正视这个问题”,与后文逐步克服呼应。"},{"id":2,"answer":"B","explanation":"in front of a mirror 对着镜子练习,是常见表达。"},{"id":3,"answer":"A","explanation":"join a group 加入学习小组,符合组建小组的语境。"},{"id":4,"answer":"B","explanation":"voice shook 声音发抖,描写初次发言的紧张。"},{"id":5,"answer":"C","explanation":"confidence grew 信心增强,与 Week by week 渐进语义一致。"},{"id":6,"answer":"A","explanation":"without fear 毫不害怕,表明克服了紧张心理。"},{"id":7,"answer":"A","explanation":"the key was not talent but practice:关键是练习而非天赋,与后文并列。"},{"id":8,"answer":"A","explanation":"as long as 只要,引导条件状语,符合“只要愿意尝试”语义。"},{"id":9,"answer":"C","explanation":"helps newcomers 帮助新生,呼应分享经验的语境。"},{"id":10,"answer":"D","explanation":"never give up 永不放弃,固定搭配,收束全文主题。"}]}',1,20.0,2.0,1) AS new
