VALUES ('cloze-teacher-1','cloze','teacher','{"type":"teacher","meta":{"teacherName":"王老师","school":"启航班工作室"}}','王老师·模拟完形填空 Passage 1',3,'["上下文逻辑","名词辨析"]','{"id":"cloze-teacher-1","type":"cloze","source":{"type":"teacher","meta":{"teacherName":"王老师","school":"启航班工作室"}},"passage":"Wang Lin never liked running. In high school, she was always the last one in the 800-meter test. Everything changed when she entered college and found a running [[1]] on campus. Her coach told her not to care about [[2]] but about finishing. She started with slow jogs at dawn. At first, even one kilometer made her out of [[3]]. But she kept a training diary and recorded every small [[4]]. After three months, she finished a five-kilometer race. The moment she crossed the line, she could not [[5]] her feelings. Running taught her that progress is made with [[6]] steps. Now she runs to clear her mind before exams. “My legs are stronger, and so is my [[7]],” she says. Last month, she [[8]] a campus fun run for beginners. More than fifty students joined her [[9]]. She hopes to run a half marathon next year, step by [[10]] of course.","blanks":[{"id":1,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"club"},{"key":"B","text":"shop"},{"key":"C","text":"class"},{"key":"D","text":"library"}]},{"id":2,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"speed"},{"key":"B","text":"weather"},{"key":"C","text":"clothes"},{"key":"D","text":"diet"}]},{"id":3,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"breath"},{"key":"B","text":"order"},{"key":"C","text":"date"},{"key":"D","text":"sight"}]},{"id":4,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"mistake"},{"key":"B","text":"victory"},{"key":"C","text":"promise"},{"key":"D","text":"secret"}]},{"id":5,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"control"},{"key":"B","text":"doubt"},{"key":"C","text":"trust"},{"key":"D","text":"spare"}]},{"id":6,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"giant"},{"key":"B","text":"careless"},{"key":"C","text":"steady"},{"key":"D","text":"sudden"}]},{"id":7,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"will"},{"key":"B","text":"shadow"},{"key":"C","text":"noise"},{"key":"D","text":"sleeve"}]},{"id":8,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"refused"},{"key":"B","text":"organized"},{"key":"C","text":"canceled"},{"key":"D","text":"bought"}]},{"id":9,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"dishes"},{"key":"B","text":"bikes"},{"key":"C","text":"run"},{"key":"D","text":"meeting"}]},{"id":10,"options":[{"key":"A","text":"end"},{"key":"B","text":"step"},{"key":"C","text":"day"},{"key":"D","text":"lane"}]}]}','{"blanks":[{"id":1,"answer":"A","explanation":"a running club 跑步社团,与教练出现的下文一致。"},{"id":2,"answer":"A","explanation":"not care about speed but finishing 不在意速度而在意完成。"},{"id":3,"answer":"A","explanation":"out of breath 上气不接下气,固定搭配。"},{"id":4,"answer":"B","explanation":"recorded every small victory 记录每次小胜利,与训练日记呼应。"},{"id":5,"answer":"A","explanation":"could not control her feelings 无法控制情绪,激动之情溢于言表。"},{"id":6,"answer":"C","explanation":"steady steps 稳健的步伐,象征循序渐进的进步。"},{"id":7,"answer":"A","explanation":"so is my will 意志力也更强了,与双腿更健壮并列。"},{"id":8,"answer":"B","explanation":"organized a campus fun run 组织趣味跑,与新手参与呼应。"},{"id":9,"answer":"C","explanation":"joined her run 参加了她的跑步活动。"},{"id":10,"answer":"B","explanation":"step by step 一步一步,呼应全文主题并巧妙双关。"}]}',1,20.0,2.0,1) AS new
